      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just \"stressful.\" everything i've worked for is just... gone. i've spent my entire 20s on this. my whole identity was being this researcher, this person who actually had something to contribute. now i'm just this joke. i look at the door to the lab and i just feel this crushing weight. it feels like there's no actual version of my future where things work out after this. it's just a dead end.",
